### Reference data — Sprint 3 (Member 4)
### All five are GET-only, gated by the CanView policy (any authenticated role).

GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sources
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AquaBlend.Api_Token}}

###

GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/plants
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AquaBlend.Api_Token}}

###

GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/demand-zones
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AquaBlend.Api_Token}}

###

GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/network-links
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AquaBlend.Api_Token}}

###

GET {{AquaBlend.Api_HostAddress}}/api/quality-profiles
Accept: application/json
